TAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}優しいね。でも心配いらない、あの冒険者のお姉さんに教えてもらった、一瞬で手まりを爆弾にする方法を。","nextNodeIds":[721760719]},{"nodeId":721760719,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3819223778,"text":"危ないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[721760720]},{"nodeId":721760720,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20338,"speakerName":"鯨井坊や","textMapHash":3905094418,"text":"危なくないよ！ヒルチャールもスライムも、悪いヤツらも、たくさんドカーンして来たんだ。","nextNodeIds":[721760721]},{"nodeId":721760721,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":769114178,"text":"おまえの方が危険人物だった！","nextNodeIds":[721760722]},{"nodeId":721760722,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20338,"speakerName":"鯨井坊や","textMapHash":3357955410,"text":"#そうだ、{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}も友達と手まりを遊びたいなら…","nextNodeIds":[721760723]},{"nodeId":721760723,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20338,"speakerName":"鯨井坊や","textMapHash":3060691754,"text":"ここに1個残しておくよ！遊び方は…","nextNodeIds":[721760724]},{"nodeId":721760724,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20338,"speakerName":"鯨井坊や","textMapHash":3411336090,"text":"手まりを隠す時は、手まり唄が1曲終わるまでにちゃんと隠す。探す人も手まり歌が1曲終わるまでに探し出す。これで公平でしょ。","nextNodeIds":[721760725]},{"nodeId":721760725,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1723654178,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[721760726]},{"nodeId":721760726,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4026958202,"text":"オイラたちが遊んでたのが爆弾だったと考えると、怖いな…","nextNodeIds":[721760727]},{"nodeId":721760727,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20338,"speakerName":"鯨井坊や","textMapHash":549755362,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}怖がらないで、「悪いヤツしかドカーンしない、たぶん」って、お姉さんが言ってたから。","nextNodeIds":[721760728]},{"nodeId":721760728,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2922169650,"text":"「たぶん」！？","ne